sequenceDiagram
    actor Requester
    actor Manager
    actor DataOwner as Data Owner
    participant Application
    participant Provisioning

    Requester->>Application: Create draft request
    Requester->>Application: Submit request
    Application->>Manager: Request approval
    Manager->>Application: Approve request
    Application->>DataOwner: Request approval
    DataOwner->>Application: Approve request
    Application->>Provisioning: Provision access
    Provisioning-->>Application: Access granted
    Application-->>Requester: Request provisioned

    Note over Application,DataOwner: Security review occurs outside the application and does not affect routing
